  "details": "Each image are taken while inputting same text of above node.\n1. There's no problem if without IME (Input Method Editor). The area becomes bigger as it needs more space for overflowed text.\n2. With Japanese IME, The area continues to be single row even if overflow occurs.\nThis might be a bug of Unity's TextField. When multiline property is false and `-unity-word-wrap: true;` in USS. If so I guess it's difficult to fix. Anyway, I write this issue as a record.\nWorkaround: Make the comment node bigger before editing. Or edit text with other tool and copy and paste.\nVersion: VRCSDK-UDON-2020.06.10.11.29_Closed_Community_Test",
